            <div xml:id="d172-a9">

                <pb facs="0385" n="285" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg285"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 9 in No. 705.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hunter to Mr. Bandinel.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Bandinel</hi>: The only secular
                    instruction given in my school is in geography. I have given half a dozen
                    children—three girls and three boys—lessons in English. The lessons are merely
                    in reading and writing.</p>
                <p>This is all I have to say in reply to your communication of the 18th instant.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>J. M. HUNTER,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Medical
                        Missionary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
